00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:06.870
This is Kongo Private Academy, which was built on a diamond mine.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:06.870
My father used to live in Tokyo making fireworks, but when he got scouted by

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:06.870
a mining company, our family moved out here, to the other side of the world.

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:07.950
It's been three months since I transferred to this school,

00:03:06.870 --> 00:03:07.950
where you can always hear the sound of dynamite exploding.

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:08.950
I got over the language barrier and have been enjoying school life

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:08.950
with my new friends, but sometimes I'll suddenly get pretty homesick.

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:09.950
The guys here will dynamite streets and railroads without warning.

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:09.950
Watching them make a mad dash for it makes me remember our life back home even more.

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:11.120
I just want to live my life in peace...

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:15.120
Ooh! Is this girl the main heroine?

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:17.950
These thoughts were in my head as I passed by the rows of cherry blossom trees

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:17.950
in front of the school... and that's when I saw HER standing there.

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:17.750
YoungBOOM! has a famous voice actress for each

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:21.250
of the younger sister roles, so there is no "main."

00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:26.950
She noticed me too, and looked at me with a surprised, almost disgusted sort of face.

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:27.080
However! This character, Hikari, is based on the famous

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:27.080
actor Hikaru Kongo, who's really popular right now.

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:27.950
Her name is "Hikari."

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:29.830
So, naturally, she's become a favorite character.

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:28.950
She's head of Kongo Academy's student council, and is blessed with both intelligence

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:28.950
and beauty. Her father is the academy's director and head of the diamond

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:28.950
mining company. It's no exaggeration to say she's one of this city's major players.

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:29.910
My dad is practically under lock and key at the mining comapny's research lab, which means

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:29.910
he has to reside at her mansion - or, rather, he's pretty much under house arrest there.

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:29.910
He's under 24-hour watch, so his life is neither pleasant nor free.

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:33.700
They've already started selling merchandise

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:33.700
for this character online.

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:38.620
