00:16:43.910 --> 00:16:45.700
I never thought you'd get THIS happy!

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:50.080
You sure lucked out, huh, Kirie?

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:50.080
Also, this thing is really well made!

00:16:50.080 --> 00:16:52.370
You can only buy it at anime events.

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:59.330
That's it! I'll give it to my Master!

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:59.330
If it's mine, it should be all right to give it away!

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:06.950
I can't have something so LEWD

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:06.950
